 style="width:100%"><p>Asked</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="b107369f-6842-43c6-a5e5-6e1c491df77b" class="r-ztohwl alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Questions?</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="58fa5d1c-5216-4734-a38a-36eedde418c5" class="r-sxj3j4 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h3>Answers to Your Questions!</h3></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="6750f49c-d587-4b33-a4e9-73a74d599b59" class="r-ivzcjv"><div data-rid="28d2fd93-270f-4138-ae9f-bd352b86c473" class="r-1dub9w"><div data-rid="8d6df121-ae24-4b50-98c3-bc19035cc967" class="r-2jsimu alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><h2>Choosing the Right Product</h2></span></div><div data-rid="b06ea9c4-d17a-4d0e-a923-7bc884314fc2" class="r-1liznle" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="9430f30a-430a-49a6-981d-18044225a5ff" class="r-s5sppt" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="6186b697-533a-4a71-8082-e09bc5dd10c4" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="replo-:R31j2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1h5djrz r-jo6q4k"><div data-rid="5c936c63-43bd-47b9-9dcb-100c9e5304f3" class="r-l5ejnq alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How do I know what style to get?</p></span></div><picture data-rid="0c2adc29-8c1e-4cae-affe-875e5d744b3d" class="r-bayp4t"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/89a72fba-452d-471a-b93d-bd4fa1472c5c?width=40" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/89a72fba-452d-471a-b93d-bd4fa1472c5c?width=48" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/89a72fba-452d-471a-b93d-bd4fa1472c5c?width=48" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/89a72fba-452d-471a-b93d-bd4fa1472c5c" alt="" class="r-dkbzgu" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="replo-animated" id="replo-:R31j2:"><div data-rid="d36b698f-4530-48f7-a521-b2a6f7677968" class="r-6uvdof"><div data-rid="7849f2ce-567b-442e-90f1-8c8170db916d" class="r-1m0e2w2 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The best Honey Cloudz product depends on your body, your goals, and whether you need a bra insert or a breast form.</p><br><p>Here's a quick guide:</p><p><br></p></span></div><div data-rid="e56b275c-1735-4eb5-82fc-5c8a3e32ec24" class="r-19td4dm"><div data-rid="6ccd0757-f95a-415c-bdb1-0888dce66dde" class="r-w0xmsv"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-circle" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="presentation"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle></svg></span></div><div data-rid="6cfeebbf-a366-44d0-87ec-2259a98c1b84" class="r-1s3q006 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>For strictly nipple coverage:</strong><br>Our <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/solution/products/oval-lites-bra-inserts"><u>Oval Lites</u></a> are our lightest insert in our line up and provide barely-there nipple coverage (very comparable to nipple covers just without any adhesive).</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="c137113f-a117-429b-8147-270752c6a38d" class="r-1vwtzo7"><div data-rid="605d1048-3a30-4d05-88f6-f3e38c5131c2" class="r-tetccr"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-circle" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="presentation"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle></svg></span></div><div data-rid="4c57dc1b-0186-4e21-9452-17a98d3d5cc7" class="r-1comja3 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>For light shaping or balancing less than ½ cup:</strong><br>Choose our <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/coverage#classics"><u>Classics Collection</u></a>. In thickness this collection compares to the traditional thickness in swimsuit and sports bra inserts.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="7f250873-a3df-4e8d-9b15-7cdcb4fc4885" class="r-16hcvva"><div data-rid="547a933a-a3d9-49fb-a05c-b5729713a439" class="r-8slco8"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-circle" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="presentation"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle></svg></span></div><div data-rid="81852f4b-84f7-4183-9acb-b4f56a4ffe38" class="r-aytwzi alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>For medium shaping or balancing a ½–¾ cup difference:</strong><br>Choose our <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/coverage#plus+"><u>Plus+ Collection</u></a>. They're approximately twice as thick as our Classics for additional fullness, shaping and balancing.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="5a841860-9502-4d79-81b1-74086e664ab5" class="r-s08u3o"><div data-rid="9181a48d-6f60-4073-8cde-50060ceb2265" class="r-13x6m2x"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-circle" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="presentation"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle></svg></span></div><div data-rid="14fff467-d00a-46cc-a990-24904199b816" class="r-qoqsgt alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>For significant breast asymmetry (greater than ¾ cup):<br></strong>Our <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/products/oval-breast-form"><u>Oval Breast Form</u></a> is often the best solution. Some women also choose to wear two <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/solution/products/ovals-plus-bra-inserts"><u>Oval Plus+ Bra Inserts</u></a> on one side for customized balancing.<br></p></span></div></div><div data-rid="54ab06f3-c81e-41a8-a7c7-b0d48e56dd30" class="r-zuby35"><div data-rid="84efda08-8e42-40b1-8597-7730361bac75" class="r-d56m3v"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-circle" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="presentation"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle></svg></span></div><div data-rid="a353fa67-e31d-4c02-b613-2fc5b221c7cb" class="r-1myq4pi alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>After a single or double mastectomy:</strong><br>Our lightweight <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/solution/products/teardrop-breast-form"><u>Teardrop Breast Form</u></a> is our most popular option. It offers the fullest shape and thickness overall.  Our <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/products/oval-breast-form"><u>Oval Breast Form</u></a> is another excellent choice, especially for women who prefer less projection. In person comfort of one design over another can be a deciding factor.<br></p></span></div></div><div data-rid="fc7e918e-8379-415a-9a16-61b8b0ba1d7d" class="r-1z0h1fr"><div data-rid="3b3c3189-9293-41ee-ac76-82a5693a3c81" class="r-1lonz0q"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-circle" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="presentation"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle></svg></span></div><div data-rid="b8a8aec5-0b93-4608-9872-67e1593c017e" class="r-py2a3k alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>After tissue expander surgery or breast reconstruction:</strong><br>Many women prefer our <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/coverage#classics"><u>Classics</u></a> or <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/coverage#plus+"><u>Plus+</u></a> Bra Inserts to restore symmetry, add fullness, or create a more natural shape.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="cc452e02-84ae-4b46-9c4c-a5f2b41c386f" class="r-yb5fyb"><div data-rid="8f376163-d879-4a15-ad3d-42d0ab3ed539" class="r-1rnezrv"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-circle" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="presentation"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle></svg></span></div><div data-rid="19100959-5ef7-4d91-bb6d-63c880bf8b1b" class="r-1gvtprt alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>For implants that appear flat across:</strong><br>Our <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/solution/products/ovals-classic-bra-inserts"><u>Oval Classics</u></a> and <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/solution/products/ovals-plus-bra-inserts"><u>Oval Plus+ Bra Inserts</u></a> help restore upper fullness and create a more rounded silhouette.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="f43519cb-c685-49f7-9480-fa916d4365d1" class="r-1cxg0dj"><div data-rid="cef95885-425e-4a73-93e8-751f42bddc93" class="r-4v2okn"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-circle" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="presentation"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle></svg></span></div><div data-rid="d5058e88-2264-44f9-a0d4-6e03e76196b3" class="r-1p6hfs1 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>After breast implant removal (explant surgery):</strong><br>Many women love our <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/coverage#plus+"><u>Plus+ Collection</u></a> for everyday shaping. Depending on your desired look, our <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/coverage#push-ups"><u>Push-Ups</u></a> or lightweight <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/coverage#breast-forms"><u>Breast Forms</u></a> can also provide additional fullness.<br></p></span></div></div><div data-rid="517962c6-7a32-494a-9474-d2bc2c516663" class="r-16g9un3"><div data-rid="8ce6cf87-9d4a-4f5d-ac4e-d9322bd7f025" class="r-q0llim"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-circle" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: auto" role="presentation"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle></svg></span></div><div data-rid="cce340dc-e679-4971-9305-b9fced435a24" class="r-1aijem0 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>For sagging breasts or extra lift:</strong><br>Our <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/coverage#push-ups"><u>Push-Up Collection</u></a> provides our greatest lift and shaping, while our <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/coverage#plus+"><u>Plus+ Collection</u></a> offers a more natural enhancement with slight lift.<br></p></span></div></div><div data-rid="e344ed2e-fd32-4102-a4a2-99de3c464508" class="r-1vynd95 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>If you're still unsure, take our <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/pages/style-finder"><u>Product Finder Quiz</u></a> or contact our team <a href="mailto:support@honeycloudz.com"><u>here</u></a>. We're happy to help you choose the best Honey Cloudz product for your body and lifestyle.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="36f04f87-1258-4abc-90e3-05bb128e2a42" class="r-1p1zj3g" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="73d8de9b-540c-4b0b-851c-4d5e10992e10" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R51j2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-4sb5mq"><div data-rid="c0f7b3da-3f10-4273-9700-6c0946e14ab4" class="r-tpac8f alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What's the difference between the Classics and Plus+ Bra Inserts Collection?</p></span></div><picture data-rid="bc399ce6-ed72-46ab-a428-93d707b2601a" class="r-n88guv"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=40" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639" class="r-1t4zhho" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R51j2:"><div data-rid="4ff0cdc8-a8b4-42a5-b86f-f187ec8fce1c" class="r-j4y00i"><div data-rid="d7b9a1a3-9629-4cd0-88aa-1b1f2c4c0002" class="r-esod8o alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>In one word, thickness. The <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/coverage#classics"><u>Classics Collection</u></a> is light to medium thickness. The thickness could be compared to what comes with swimsuits and sports bras. The <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/coverage#plus+"><u>Plus+ Collection</u></a> is double the thickness of the classics.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="338bc2f8-12c2-46b8-9fa4-4218eebf1322" class="r-1mjc7gz" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="9e598e82-6630-44ce-b5ee-49f54454729a" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R71j2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-vozybx"><div data-rid="36102b7e-c602-4eca-99a7-82998a4c3293" class="r-i3l6oz alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Which bra insert shape should I get?</p></span></div><picture data-rid="67231050-d93a-471a-9002-c193caa97cf2" class="r-x0wms9"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=40" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639" class="r-1exr7rq" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R71j2:"><div data-rid="e05918fd-dcaa-4098-911a-fc6a57ee3099" class="r-1hzvmo6"><div data-rid="dfee98ef-2a07-4982-8b3f-5ea675071523" class="r-251qky alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/shape#oval"><u>Oval</u></a>, <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/shape#triangle"><u>Triangle</u></a>, or <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/shape#half-moon"><u>Half Moon</u></a>? Overall all 3 shapes can all be worn inside different types of clothing.</p><p><br></p><p>For upper breast volume loss, many women like the <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/shape#half-moon"><u>Half Moon shape</u></a> best because it comes up higher on the breast and adds back some shape, volume there.</p><p><br></p><p>The <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/shape#triangle"><u>Triangle shape</u></a> works best for triangle shaped swimsuits, bralettes/bras because it fills in and matches that shape best.</p><p><br></p><p>The <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/shape#oval"><u>Oval shape</u></a> can work best for bandeau tops/swimsuits. It can also work best for underwire bras because it matches the underwire shape best.</p><p><br></p><p>Beyond this it can be comfort in person, our individual breast tissue and desired look.</p><p><br></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="af806b61-f23a-48ef-bf0f-be05a1198dca" class="r-1vqi3rb" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="ab39f020-1c33-46f4-b1cf-c1da1c238c8b" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R91j2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1ptm9h7"><div data-rid="902a86dd-a99e-45c5-a3ba-2d2bba56ffcd" class="r-mg1g9j alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What's the difference between the Teardrop and Oval Breast Forms?</p></span></div><picture data-rid="e8f59a3e-f94f-4483-8596-ee0c648c416f" class="r-fe423g"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=40" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639" class="r-ei7isd" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R91j2:"><div data-rid="a4d17f44-140d-4e6b-af8e-e1db6ad620d8" class="r-8lu7rq"><div data-rid="4b7f2103-fd1d-46e3-ab81-7de61f8ddca9" class="r-awc66i alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Firstly it can be individually based on comfort and look in person. With varying surgeries, scars, lymphedema and radiation sensitivities, trying on in person is the best way to know which is best for you.</p><br><p>The <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/solution/products/teardrop-breast-form"><u>Teardrop Breast Form</u></a> is taller in design so it creates a bit more shape higher on the chest than the oval does. The Teardrop is also slightly thicker in sizes XS-L than the Oval form. In sizes XL-3X the Teardrop is significantly thicker. If fullness and projection is #1 on your list, opt for the Teardrop. Both styles work great in swimsuits, sports bras and wireless styles.</p><br><p>The <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/products/oval-breast-form"><u>Oval Breast Form</u></a> leans better in underwire bras due to its shape matching the curves best.</p><p><br></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="37b9e55e-961b-4fcf-8b57-d24267c27e20" class="r-17j2jft" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="e3f99793-6b6d-40a4-95c6-1ecefe20298c" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rb1j2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-ogu52m"><div data-rid="38a2f6d8-17ec-47ab-8b69-df7067bc8b0a" class="r-a2z7wy alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What's best for uneven breasts?</p></span></div><picture data-rid="03ed397b-016c-45b9-8df1-28b3b4cc3a6f" class="r-gyy6xf"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=40" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><sourc