 <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/coverage#classics"><u>Classics Collection</u></a> and for coverage and extra shaping, our <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/coverage#plus+"><u>Plus+ Collection</u></a> is your go-to.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="175e1acc-5e77-4746-b163-7761a24698f4" class="r-6e8z39" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="8e7a552d-710d-4e99-a097-f285dc930bf6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R52j2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1g9ba5j"><div data-rid="3d10407e-e8d1-4c59-82d9-dea14fd02223" class="r-b3jous alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Which Honey Cloudz are best after a lumpectomy?</p></span></div><picture data-rid="fbc8d37c-6d48-4847-8823-49a6d2cc64fd" class="r-14q7s6y"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=40" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639" class="r-110b1rz" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R52j2:"><div data-rid="4dd14eb9-7ac0-403f-becc-681cd418b166" class="r-46dseg"><div data-rid="f544d7fd-fcbc-4b0b-b35c-89ca3d6cdbbf" class="r-195infn alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Our number one shape post lumpectomy is our <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/shape/products/triangle-classic-bra-inserts"><u>Triangle Classic</u></a> for minimal tissue removal and slight smoothing is needed or <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/shape/products/triangle-plus-bra-inserts"><u>Triangle Plus+</u></a> ideal for more moderate tissue removal and greater smoothing needs.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="c1e2f13f-5b18-4808-b0fa-024f6bf3d0ca" class="r-134c2al" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="514e7147-f8b8-4382-b7ef-23876b38a513" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R72j2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1um90z5"><div data-rid="d11d7875-854e-4313-a7e4-eb6d32ca1096" class="r-1axwanh alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What's best after radiation?</p></span></div><picture data-rid="ba92bdb6-34e4-4e10-9be9-922f1d707f28" class="r-1bie6iv"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=40" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639" class="r-1yn87jl" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R72j2:"><div data-rid="d215d950-2f59-4904-9520-4351f7cb3356" class="r-1bhp46"><div data-rid="393f12f5-d96d-4d4b-ab81-e9b5e4e05fdf" class="r-aejimd alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Unfortunately one of the longer side effects of radiation is tissue shrinkage. Our <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/solution/products/ovals-classic-bra-inserts"><u>Oval Classics</u></a> can help add up to ¼ cup back with natural looking shaping. Our <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/solution/products/ovals-plus-bra-inserts"><u>Oval Plus+</u></a> is the go-to when you need a good ½ cup-¾ cup restored. For more significant shrinkage the <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/shape/products/oval-breast-form"><u>Oval Breast Form</u></a> can help add a full cup+ back to the smaller breast. Another suggestion is wearing a pair of the <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/solution/products/ovals-plus-bra-inserts"><u>Oval Plus+</u></a> inserts on one side. Our inserts stack nicely and can help create additional volume.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="de3a1933-1d96-49cd-a56d-0fbeafe550e5" class="r-w4umuz" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="3be493d2-6f7b-4cce-be47-0c294637d625" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R92j2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1g0cu71"><div data-rid="5fd7d77a-1bbc-4f45-9f24-b2fa223088b4" class="r-1allfo7 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What's best if I have tissue expanders?</p></span></div><picture data-rid="2f9e9a89-fc9e-4e25-86c6-b754107f13b1" class="r-74xhxk"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=40" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639" class="r-n3cb8y" loading="lazy"/></picture></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R92j2:"><div data-rid="b2830b48-f7e0-45d6-91ef-6a9c87524466" class="r-1xks2iz"><div data-rid="f20402f1-bd35-4174-b490-320a6a0f7499" class="r-j9a730 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>For the period when tissue expanders are worn, women sometimes look for additional shaping or balance. Our <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/solution/products/ovals-classic-bra-inserts"><u>Oval Classic</u></a>, <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/solution/products/ovals-plus-bra-inserts"><u>Oval Plus</u></a>, <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/shape/products/half-moons-bra-inserts"><u>Half Moon Classic </u></a>or <a href="https://www.honeycloudz.com/collections/shape/products/half-moon-plus-bra-inserts"><u>Half Moon Plus</u></a> are most popular for this specific need.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="e1064c7a-efbb-4153-a241-ffd500ae8cca" class="r-wknt40" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="ec2918c5-be6c-48c0-a101-162b979817f3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rb2j2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1prhea7"><div data-rid="7965be97-80a9-46ab-b282-3916693c9052" class="r-1bv0j57 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What's best after DIEP flap reconstruction?</p></span></div><picture data-rid="3a1865f2-ed38-49a8-af8e-6c2938e3225e" class="r-1mynsuk"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=40" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639?width=48" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/a2c7c51a-ec22-4e36-a9ea-6f00296360e2/b8841636-2636-4c73-ac94-db12e1167639" class="r-hr022z" loading=